# Dependencies & build output
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Playwright's browser-lane output (apps/web/e2e, once that app lands), both
# regenerated by the next run. `test-results/` is the per-test artifacts —
# traces and screenshots, which the config captures on failing tests only, so a
# green run leaves nothing there but Playwright's own `.last-run.json`;
# `playwright-report/` is the HTML report, which the reporter writes on every
# run, green ones included.
# Unanchored so they match wherever a config puts them.
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Agent git worktrees (created by .claude tooling inside the repo)
.claude/worktrees/

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.log

# Course content — the repo never contains real lecture material (CLAUDE.md
# Hard constraints). `data/` is where the app keeps uploaded decks and per-course
# indexes; the extensions are the floor until the `check:no-course-content` gate
# exists. The synthetic eval deck is authored as text under eval/, never as one
# of these.
data/
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.key
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
